dex: 9999` and `.modal-overlay` has `z-index: 1000`. This is fine — toasts appear above modals. But the `#ambient-canvas` has `z-index: 0` and `.app-layout` has `z-index: 10`. Make sure the stacking is documented as intentional.\n\nNo change needed here — the stacking is correct. Skip this one.\n\n### CSS FIX 4 — Missing responsive rule for enterprise-tabs-nav on small screens\nOn very small screens (<600px), the tab triggers overflow horizontally without scrolling.\n\nAdd this after the existing `.enterprise-tabs-nav` block:\n```\n\n/* FIX: Horizontal scroll for tab navigation on small screens */\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .enterprise-tabs-nav {\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    flex-wrap: nowrap;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n  }\n  .tab-trigger span {\n    display: none;\n  }\n  .tab-trigger {\n    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFind the closing `}` of the `.tab-badge.blue-badge` rule:\n```\n.tab-badge.blue-badge {\n  border-color: var(--electric-border);\n  color: var(--electric);\n}\n```\nand AFTER it, add the responsive rule above.\n\n### CSS FIX 5 — Missing .w-full utility class used in HTML\nThe HTML uses `class=\"btn btn-emerald w-full\"` but `w-full` is never defined.\n\nAdd at the end of the button section (after the `.btn-sm` rule):\n```\n\n/* FIX: Missing utility class used in driver registration button */\n.w-full { width: 100%; }\n.flex-1 { flex: 1; }\n```\n\nActually `.flex-1` is also used. Add both.\n\nFind:\n```\n.btn-sm {\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;\n  font-size: 0.74rem;\n}\n```\nAnd AFTER its closing `}`, add:\n```\n\n/* FIX: Missing utility classes used in HTML */\n.w-full { width: 100%; }\n.flex-1 { flex: 1; }\n```\n\n### CSS FIX 6 — Missing Tailwind-like utility classes used in HTML\nThe HTML extensively uses Tailwind-like classes (`text-xs`, `text-sm`, `font-bold`, `font-semibold`, `font-mono`, `text-emerald`, `text-electric`, `text-slate-500`, `flex`, `items-center`, `gap-2`, `gap-3`, `justify-between`, `mt-0.5`, `mt-1`, `pt-1`, `ml-1`, `ml-2`, `p-3`, `border-t`, `border-slate-200`, `bg-emerald-50`, `border-emerald-200`, `rounded-xl`, `text-lg`, `truncate`, `max-w-[42px]`, `text-[9px]`, `text-[10px]`, `text-[11px]`, `hover:underline` etc.) that have NO CSS definitions. These are all broken without Tailwind being included.\n\nAdd a comprehensive utility class block at the end of the file. Append this:\n\n```\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   FIX: Utility classes used in dynamic HTML (Tailwind-like, defined manually)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.flex { display: flex; }\n.inline-flex { display: inline-flex; }\n.items-center { align-items: center; }\n.justify-between { justify-content: space-between; }\n.gap-2 { gap: 0.5rem; }\n.gap-3 { gap: 0.75rem; }\n.p-3 { padding: 0.75rem; }\n.mt-0\\.5, .mt-0-5 { margin-top: 0.125rem; }\n.mt-1 { margin-top: 0.25rem; }\n.ml-1 { margin-left: 0.25rem; }\n.ml-2 { margin-left: 0.5rem; }\n.pt-1 { padding-top: 0.25rem; }\n.border-t { border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; }\n.border-slate-200 { border-color: var(--slate-200); }\n.text-xs { font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1rem; }\n.text-sm { font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; }\n.text-base { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; }\n.text-lg { font-size: 1.125rem; }\n.text-xl { font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.75rem; }\n.text-2xl { font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; }\n.font-bold { font-weight: 700; }\n.font-semibold { font-weight: 600; }\n.font-medium { font-weight: 500; }\n.font-mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); }\n.text-emerald { color: var(--emerald); }\n.text-electric { color: var(--electric); }\n.text-rose { color: var(--rose); }\n.text-rose-500 { color: #F43F5E; }\n.text-amber-500 { color: #F59E0B; }\n.text-amber-600 { color: #D97706; }\n.text-amber-700 { color: #B45309; }\n.text-purple-600 { color: #7C3AED; }\n.text-teal-600 { color: #0D9488; }\n.text-slate-500 { color: var(--slate-500); }\n.text-slate-600 { color: var(--slate-600); }\n.text-slate-700 { color: var(--slate-700); }\n.text-slate-800 { color: var(--slate-800); }\n.text-slate-900 { color: var(--slate-900); }\n.bg-emerald-50 { background-color: #ECFDF5; }\n.border-emerald-200 { border-color: #A7F3D0; }\n.bg-rose-50 { background-color: #FFF1F2; }\n.border-rose-200 { border-color: #FECDD3; }\n.rounded-xl { border-radius: 0.75rem; }\n.truncate { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }\n.tracking-wider { letter-spacing: 0.05em; }\n.hover\\:underline:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n\n/* Bracket-notation size classes */\n.text-\\[9px\\] { font-size: 9px; }\n.text-\\[10px\\] { font-size: 10px; }\n.text-\\[11px\\] { font-size: 11px; }\n.max-w-\\[42px\\] { max-width: 42px; }\n```\n\n## HTML FIXES (index.html):\n\n### HTML FIX 1 — Missing meta description tag for SEO\nNot a bug per se, but add a `<meta name=\"description\">` tag for completeness. SKIP THIS — not a bug.\n\n### HTML FIX 2 — Passive wheel event listener warning\nThe canvas `wheel` event in app.js calls `e.preventDefault()` which requires a non-passive listener. Browsers default wheel listeners to passive on certain elements. This is handled in JS, not HTML, so SKIP.\n\nNo HTML changes are needed. The HTML structure is correct. Only apply the CSS fixes above.\n\nAfter all edits, reply with the numbered list of every fix you applied.\n","Role":"CSS and HTML Bug Fixer","TypeName":"code_fixer"}}]}
